Z||000010||fierogt88||01-18-2001||09:20 AM||||I drove up there to see the 84 daily driver that he was selling.  I didn't end up getting it (wife said she gets a house before I get another car) but I got to see quite a few FINE fieros.<P>Your Indy looks sweet.  I would say it's 90%.  The interior was in prime condition, except for the door side of the drivers seat, which the leather was all cracked up.  The body panels were perfectly straight and undamaged, though there were some places where the paint was "worn" (too much covering??).  The trunk/engine compartment had rust but it seemed to be isolated to the upper left and in my opinion could be repaired during a full restoration.  I think you will be very happy with it.<P>Doug also had two black 88 gt's in wonderful condition, and a project car with a 3.4 (and a few others). He's gonna need security to keep me from visiting again  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
